COMPILATION OF: E52VI

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52VI

   1 a 0000 E52VI: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-9 probe VI (PLAN sec P3-9 H7 DISCRIMINATOR):
   4 a 0006       ONE object, widths 10 AND 9. PAR predicts a MIXED push
   5 a 0006       order (p even => var first; q odd => literal first); ADD
   6 a 0006       predicts literal-first for both pool cells; a per-program
   7 a 0006       rule predicts uniform order. Zero cells pooled ONCE per
   8 a 0006       width ([C155]). */
   9 a 0006 
  10 c 0006    dcl p fixed dec(10,2);
  11 c 0006    dcl q fixed dec(9,2);
  12 c 0006    dcl dl fixed binary;
  13 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
  14 c 0006 
  15 c 0006    if p = 0 | dl > 1 then x = 1;
  16 c 002F    x = 2;
  17 c 0035    if q = 0 | p = 0 then x = 3;
  18 c 006D    x = 4;
  19 c 0073 
  20 a 0073 end E52VI;

CODE SIZE = 0076
DATA AREA = 001A
FREE SYMS = 3864
END  COMPILATION
